# Ignore everything at the repo root
/*

# Keep only these at the root
!/.gitignore
!/extension/
!/readme.md
!/index.html
!/LICENSE

# Inside extension/, still ignore dependencies
extension/node_modules/

# Old tsc output — superseded by esbuild dist/ bundle
extension/out/

# Local editor and macOS files
**/.DS_Store
extension/snippets/**/.clangd
extension/*.mcpb
extension/*.vsix

# Working notes stay local, wherever they land (ADRs, plans, handoffs, checks).
# Tracked docs are only readme.md, extension/readme.md and extension/server/**.
**/docs/
**/adr/
**/PLAN*.md
**/EXEC-PLAN*.md
**/HANDOFF*.md
**/*-CHECK-*.md
**/SECURITY-REVIEW*.md
**/SUGGESTIONS*.md
**/CONTEXT.md
**/next_steps.md
